@cc [owner:nareshshah139,label:product] receipt-authoritative-cache-repair
Reconciliation MUST derive paidAmount, balanceAmount and paymentStatus from completed payment
receipts. It MUST NOT change payment rows, invoice timestamps or mutationVersion. A second run
without ledger changes MUST leave every invoice unchanged.

@cc [owner:nareshshah139,label:product] overpayment-stops-repair
If rounded completed receipts exceed an invoice total, reconciliation MUST fail visibly before
changing any invoice cache. It MUST NOT repair overpayment by altering receipts.
